WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.927
A female cheetah,

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.602
training her three cubs to hunt.

00:00:21.604 --> 00:00:24.941
The easiest prey,

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:29.863
 young zebra.

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:37.954
Dad stands his ground

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:43.376
 buying time for the fold.

00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:11.863
The rookie hunters

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:13.239
cause panic.

00:01:26.544 --> 00:01:28.296
But it's not the youngsters

00:01:28.296 --> 00:01:29.798
the fold should fear.

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:37.555
It's their mom.

00:01:44.646 --> 00:01:47.649
Now she's in a race for her life.

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:55.448
With mom and dad

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:58.034
running interference.

00:02:12.674 --> 00:02:15.510
Even an experienced cheetah

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:19.222
is no match for this united family.

